+++ b/docs/subsystems/client-modules.md
@@ -82,0 +83,2 @@ Package metadata — including the negative "not a client package" verdict — i
+When an application supplies `dshTrustedPluginResolutions`, exact Host-verified entries take precedence over tree-based resolution. Discovery reads each matching package's manifest from its verified physical package root; an absent entry, mismatched manifest or escaped installation boundary fails rather than falling back to a different package search. Loader builtins remain outside the browser table. This keeps managed Host imports and browser discovery anchored to the same installation even when the CLI manifest does not directly depend on every bundle-owned client package.
+
